# Taskmaster: Architecture & Conventions (unified)

Single reference for this repo. No other .md docs; everything lives here.

---

## Project identity & stack

- **Backend:** Flask (Python), Railway. **DB/Auth/Storage:** Supabase. **AI:** OpenAI (Whisper + GPT-4o-mini). **Email:** Resend.
- **Frontend:** Separate app; `FRONTEND_URL` in config (e.g. app.willonski.com or localhost:3000).

**Git / deploy branches:** **Backend (this repo):** integration and QA on **`staging`**; production from **`main`** (Railway prod should track `main`). **Frontend (separate Next.js repo):** integration and QA on **`develop`**; production from **`main`**. Point **`develop`/staging frontend** env at the backend URL that deploys from **`staging`**; **production frontend** at the backend on **`main`**.

---

## Layout

- **Routes:** `routes/auth.py`, `session.py`, `questions.py`, `recordings.py`, `user.py`, `admin.py` (legacy/v1); **`routes/homework.py`** → **`/v2/homework/*`** (only student flow); **`routes/v2_routes.py`** → **`/v2/admin/*`** (admin only).
- **Data:** `services/db.py` (all Supabase), `services/openai_service.py`, `services/email_service.py`. Config: `config.py` only.
- **Homework:** session start/status, task step, recording_1, metric-answers, recording_2, questions, post-answers. DB: `homework_sessions`, **`tasks`** / **`tasks_pool`**, task_block, metric_questions, post_recording_questions (see `migrations/v2_all_in_one.sql` + `rename_warmup_to_tasks_and_drop_focus.sql`).

---

## Setup & running

- **Install:** `pip install -r requirements.txt`
- **Env:** Copy `.env.example` to `.env`. Required: `SUPABASE_URL`, `SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY`, `SUPABASE_JWT_SECRET`, `OPENAI_API_KEY`, `RESEND_API_KEY`, `RESEND_FROM_EMAIL`, `ADMIN_EMAIL`, `FRONTEND_URL`. Optional: `SENTRY_DSN`, `ENV`, `SEND_EMAILS`.
- **Run:** `python app.py` (local). Railway: set env in dashboard; Procfile used.
- **Migrations:** Run **`migrations/v2_all_in_one.sql`** in Supabase SQL Editor (idempotent). Then run **`rename_warmup_to_tasks_and_drop_focus.sql`** and **`rename_homework_session_status_warm_up_to_task.sql`** so **`public.tasks`**, **`public.tasks_pool`**, and session status **`task`** match the backend. Then coaching migrations in order (as needed): **`add_v2_student_coaching_memory.sql`**, etc. Then **`add_tutor_feedback_deadline.sql`** and **`add_tutor_feedback_sent_at.sql`**. For security (RLS): run **`migrations/enable_rls_public_tables.sql`**. Backend uses **SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY** and bypasses RLS. Reload PostgREST schema after SQL. Full flow checklist: **`docs/HOMEWORK-AND-PERFORMANCE.md`**. Step-0 video is **`tutor_video_url`** / **`tutor_video_description`** from **`POST .../send-assignment`**.

