## Admin (v2)

All under **`/v2/admin/*`** with admin JWT. Admin = email in `admin_users` with `is_active = true`. 403 if not admin.

**Students:** `GET /v2/admin/students` (limit, offset) → `{ students: [ { user_id, email, user_email, sessions_count?, last_session_at?, avg_performance? } ], limit, offset }`. `GET /v2/admin/students/<id>` → profile: `user_id`, `email`, `overrides`, `speaker_profile` (e.g. `coach_notes`), **`tasks`**, `last_report`, `last_report_preview`, `sessions` (id, created_at, status, report_preview.report_text_preview). `PUT .../overrides` (`assigned_task_id`, prompts, `skip_metric_questions`, pending tutor video fields, etc.). `PUT .../speaker-profile` body `{ coach_notes?, ... }`. **`POST .../send-assignment`** body optional `{ "video_url"?: "https://...", "video_description"?: "..." }` (video_url: http/https, max 2048 chars; video_description: max 2000 chars) → `{ status: "ok" }`. Email includes video link and description when provided. Frontend: **`docs/FRONTEND-VIDEO-AND-DESCRIPTION.md`**.

**Tasks (per student):** `GET/POST/PUT/DELETE /v2/admin/students/<id>/tasks` and `.../tasks/<task_id>`; atomic **`POST .../tasks/create-pool-and-assign`**.

**Session/report (admin):** `GET /v2/admin/students/<id>/sessions/<session_id>` (full session, context_long_entries). `PATCH .../sessions/<session_id>/report` body `{ action: "append"|"replace", text?, entries? }`.

**Pools:** Homework task pool: **`GET/POST/PUT/DELETE /v2/admin/tasks-pool`** and `.../tasks-pool/<pool_id>`. Admin JSON uses **`tasks_pool`** (list or single row). Legacy global “prompt” pool was archived as `v2_deprecated_prompt_tasks_archive` by `rename_warmup_to_tasks_and_drop_focus.sql`. Metric questions, metrics: existing `metric-questions`, `metrics` routes. **Focus tasks** product paths return empty / 410.

**Mockup alignment:** One student profile page — Homework Configuration (Send Homework, Save overrides, **tasks** list, **tasks_pool**, metrics), Speaker Profile (Context → coach_notes), Last Report / Reports history from sessions.

